  "body": "For instance, we want to list all users on the homeserver which aren't matching certain criteria (like users not containing `whatsapp` or `signal`). We'd like to do this on the homeserver side to avoid huge load/memory consuption on both Synapse and the processing process since we have many more users that need to be excluded than included. \r\n\r\nI'd imagine something like:\r\n\r\n`https://host/_synapse/admin/v2/users?not_user_id=whatsapp&not_user_id=signal`",
